ations it tried to sabotage Republican Senator Dan Sullivan by recruiting a candidate with the same name. NBC News’ Ryan Nobles reports.</media:description><media:subTitle type="text/srt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793315166115_nn_rno_alaska_senate_race_261029.srt"></media:subTitle><media:subTitle type="text/vtt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793315166115_nn_rno_alaska_senate_race_261029.vtt"></media:subTitle></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793315166115_nn_rno_alaska_senate_race_261029_S3_1920x1080-llffjp.jpg"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:06:11 GMT</pubDate><title>Criminal investigation into Alaska Democrat’s Senate campaign</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:08:18 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Michael Kosnar</dc:creator><dc:creator>Kyla Guilfoil</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Andrew Blankstein</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Robert Kovacik, NBC Los Angeles</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Jane C. Timm </dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:01 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The subpoenas come just a day after a federal judge called into question the process the Trump administration used to identify alleged noncitizens. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/doj-subpoenas-local-election-officials-claims-noncitizen-voting-califo-rcna606460</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/doj-subpoenas-local-election-officials-claims-noncitizen-voting-califo-rcna606460</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261015-early-voting-california-poll-election-ew-1132a-526d46.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>David Paul Morris</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Early Voting In California Ahead Of Midterm Election</media:text><media:description type="plain">The new subpoenas follow a federal judge’s ruling Wednesday to deny the Trump administration’s request to segregate 20,000 mail ballots from alleged noncitizens in California.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261015-early-voting-california-poll-election-ew-1132a-526d46.jpg" height="1666" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:01 GMT</pubDate><title>DOJ subpoenas local election officials over claims of noncitizen voting in California </title><updateDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:01 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Henry J. Gomez</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:16 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The ad roiled Ohio’s race for governor, with the Trump-endorsed Ramaswamy and Acton, the Democratic nominee, vying to lead the state.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/vivek-ramaswamys-ad-using-amy-actons-estranged-mother-ended-run-tv-rcna606441</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/vivek-ramaswamys-ad-using-amy-actons-estranged-mother-ended-run-tv-rcna606441</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-Vivek-Ramaswamy-vsb-1729-dbab1c.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>Jon Cherry</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Republican gubernatorial candidate Vivek Ramaswamy.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Many, including term-limited Gov. Mike DeWine, a Republican who has endorsed Vivek Ramaswamy, pictured, had called on him to take down the ad.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-Vivek-Ramaswamy-vsb-1729-dbab1c.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:16 GMT</pubDate><title>Vivek Ramaswamy’s attack ad against Amy Acton’s ends TV run</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:16 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:34:48 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>TODAY’s Savannah Guthrie goes behind-the-scenes with the NBC News team tasked with calling election night’s pivotal races from coast-to-coast.</description><expires>2056-10-29T11:51:58.000+0000</expires><guid isPermaLink="false">tdy_news_7a_guthrie_decision_desk_bts_261029</guid><link>https://www.today.com/video/go-behind-the-scenes-of-nbc-news-decision-desk-272458309564</link><media:content url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/tdy_news_7a_guthrie_decision_desk_bts_261029/3/abs/index.m3u8" medium="video"><media:credit></media:credit><media:title>Go Behind the Scenes of NBC News’ Decision Desk</media:title><media:player url="https://www.today.com/video/go-behind-the-scenes-of-nbc-news-decision-desk-272458309564"></media:player><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793274707955_tdy_news_7a_guthrie_decision_desk_bts_261029_S3_1920x1080-70ab20.jpg"></media:thumbnail><media:description type="plain">TODAY’s Savannah Guthrie goes behind-the-scenes with the NBC News team tasked with calling election night’s pivotal races from coast-to-coast.</media:description><media:subTitle type="text/srt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/tdy_news_7a_guthrie_decision_desk_bts_261029_1131.srt"></media:subTitle><media:subTitle type="text/vtt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/tdy_news_7a_guthrie_decision_desk_bts_261029_1131.vtt"></media:subTitle></media:content><media:thumbnail u