e. NBC News&#39; Liz Kreutz reports.</media:description><media:subTitle type="text/srt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793315824711_nn_lkr_patrick_stewart_death_261029.srt"></media:subTitle><media:subTitle type="text/vtt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793315824711_nn_lkr_patrick_stewart_death_261029.vtt"></media:subTitle></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793315824711_nn_lkr_patrick_stewart_death_261029_S3_1920x1080-ajmz7j.jpg"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:17:09 GMT</pubDate><title>Iconic actor Patrick Stewart, known for ‘Star Trek’ and ‘X-Men,’ dies at age 86</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:23:02 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:46:22 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Neither Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu nor his challenger Gadi Eisenkot is projected to win an outright parliamentary majority with more than 90% of the vote counted. NBC News’ Matt Bradley breaks down the election results and what they could mean for Israel’s political future.</description><expires>2056-10-29T14:45:54.000+0000</expires><guid isPermaLink="false">now_current_israeli_bradley_netanyahu_eisenkot_261029</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/video/tight-israeli-election-leaves-no-party-with-a-clear-majority-272469573895</link><media:content url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/now_current_israeli_bradley_netanyahu_eisenkot_261029/1/abs/index.m3u8" medium="video"><media:credit></media:credit><media:title>Neither Israeli party is expected to win an outright majority in the elections </media:title><media:player url="https://www.nbcnews.com/video/tight-israeli-election-leaves-no-party-with-a-clear-majority-272469573895"></media:player><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793285145681_now_current_israeli_bradley_netanyahu_eisenkot_261029_S3_1920x1080-2f6g60.jpg"></media:thumbnail><media:description type="plain">Neither Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu nor his challenger Gadi Eisenkot is projected to win an outright parliamentary majority with more than 90% of the vote counted. NBC News’ Matt Bradley breaks down the election results and what they could mean for Israel’s political future.</media:description><media:subTitle type="text/srt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793285145681_now_current_israeli_bradley_netanyahu_eisenkot_261029.srt"></media:subTitle><media:subTitle type="text/vtt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793285145681_now_current_israeli_bradley_netanyahu_eisenkot_261029.vtt"></media:subTitle></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793285145681_now_current_israeli_bradley_netanyahu_eisenkot_261029_S3_1920x1080-2f6g60.jpg"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:45:51 GMT</pubDate><title>Neither Israeli party is expected to win an outright majority in the elections </title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:46:22 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>David Ingram</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Kevin Collier</dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:46:29 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The exchange said it will “work closely with law enforcement, issuers, blockchain intelligence firms and industry partners to trace and freeze” assets. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/business/markets/binance-hack-tether-circle-stablecoins-rcna606445</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/business/markets/binance-hack-tether-circle-stablecoins-rcna606445</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-binance-vsb-1816-fb8d39.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Brent Lewin</media:credit><media:text type="plain">The Binance Holding Ltd. booth seen at a fair.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Binance is the world’s largest cryptocurrency trading platform by volume, with hundreds of thousands of users.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-binance-vsb-1816-fb8d39.jpg" height="1666" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:46:29 GMT</pubDate><title>Binance mounts urgent response to suspected hack as crypto platforms freeze billions </title><updateDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:03:51 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:42:57 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>New video tonight from that deadly train collision in Spain shows the urgent race to help the wounded. And new audio appears to reveal fateful moments leading up to the crash. NBC News’ Raf Sanchez reports.</description><expires>2056-10-29T23:29:24.000+0000</expires><guid isPermaLink="false">nn_rsa_SpainTrain_261029</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/nightly-news/video/death-toll-rises-from-train-collision-272505413612</link><media:content url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nn_rsa_SpainTrain_261029/1/abs/index.m3u8" medium="video"><media:credit></media:credit><media:title>Death toll rises from train collision</media:title><media:player url="https://www.nbcnews.com/nightly-news/video/death-toll-rises-from-train-collision-272505413612"></media:player><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793316556410_nn_rsa_SpainTrain_261029_S3_1920x1080-qe75oy.jpg"></media:thumbnail><media:description type="plain">New video tonight from that deadly train collision in Spain shows the urgent race to help the wounded. And new audio appears to reveal fateful moments leading up to the crash. NBC News’ Raf Sanchez reports.</media:description><media:subTitle type="text/srt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793316556410_nn_rsa_SpainTrain_261029.srt"></media:subTitle><media:subTitle type="text/vtt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/10/1793316556410_nn_rsa_SpainTrain_261029.vtt"></media:subTitle></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_10/1793316556410_nn_rsa_SpainTrain_261029_S3_1920x1080-qe75oy.jpg"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:29:21 GMT</pubDate><title>Death toll rises from train collision</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:42:57 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Andrew Greif</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:02:40 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Nate Scheelhaase, the Los Angeles Rams’ offensive coordinator, is a former youth pastor. He credits time in the church for his success in professional football. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/sports/nfl/former-youth-pastor-leading-one-nfls-best-offenses-rcna601954</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/sports/nfl/former-youth-pastor-leading-one-nfls-best-offenses-rcna601954</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-nate-scheelhaase-lr-786467.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1200" width="1800"><media:credit>Leila Register</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Photo illustration of Nate Scheelhaase</media:text><media:description type="plain"></media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-nate-scheelhaase-lr-42ef3c.jpg" t