ls-rcna606390</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/woman-pleads-guilty-murdering-best-friends-6-week-old-son-said-compuls-rcna606390</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-The--Alegheny-County-District-Attorneys-Office-ch-1434-09d58d.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>Google Maps</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Allegheny County District Attorney&#39;s Office.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Allegheny County District Attorney&#39;s Office.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-The--Alegheny-County-District-Attorneys-Office-ch-1434-09d58d.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:31:49 GMT</pubDate><title>Woman pleads guilty to murdering best friend’s 6-week-old son, said she had compulsion to harm kids</title><updateDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:31:49 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Michael Kosnar</dc:creator><dc:creator>Kyla Guilfoil</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Andrew Blankstein</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Robert Kovacik, NBC Los Angeles</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Jane C. Timm </dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:01 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The subpoenas come just a day after a federal judge called into question the process the Trump administration used to identify alleged noncitizens. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/doj-subpoenas-local-election-officials-claims-noncitizen-voting-califo-rcna606460</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/doj-subpoenas-local-election-officials-claims-noncitizen-voting-califo-rcna606460</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261015-early-voting-california-poll-election-ew-1132a-526d46.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>David Paul Morris</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Early Voting In California Ahead Of Midterm Election</media:text><media:description type="plain">The new subpoenas follow a federal judge’s ruling Wednesday to deny the Trump administration’s request to segregate 20,000 mail ballots from alleged noncitizens in California.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261015-early-voting-california-poll-election-ew-1132a-526d46.jpg" height="1666" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:01 GMT</pubDate><title>DOJ subpoenas local election officials over claims of noncitizen voting in California </title><updateDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:01 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>David Ingram</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Kevin Collier</dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:46:29 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The exchange said it will “work closely with law enforcement, issuers, blockchain intelligence firms and industry partners to trace and freeze” assets. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/business/markets/binance-hack-tether-circle-stablecoins-rcna606445</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/business/markets/binance-hack-tether-circle-stablecoins-rcna606445</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-binance-vsb-1816-fb8d39.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Brent Lewin</media:credit><media:text type="plain">The Binance Holding Ltd. booth seen at a fair.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Binance is the world’s largest cryptocurrency trading platform by volume, with hundreds of thousands of users.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-binance-vsb-1816-fb8d39.jpg" height="1666" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:46:29 GMT</pubDate><title>Binance mounts urgent response to suspected hack as crypto platforms freeze billions </title><updateDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:03:51 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Ryan J. Reilly</dc:creator><dc:creator>Tanish Bijur</dc:creator><dc:creator>Dareh Gregorian</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:28:40 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>A Pirro aide said they’d made a problematic mistake in their politically charged case against Nikki Floris and Bradley Benavides, an FBI agent testified.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/justice-department/us-attorney-jeanine-pirros-team-acknowledged-screwup-case-former-fbi-o-rcna606387</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/justice-department/us-attorney-jeanine-pirros-team-acknowledged-screwup-case-former-fbi-o-rcna606387</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-04/260410-hunter-biden-ew-1037a-a0932e.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="800" width="1200"><media:credit>Jasper Colt</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Syndication: USA TODAY</media:text><media:description type="plain">Hunter Biden leaves court with his wife, Melissa Cohen Biden, in 2024.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-04/260410-hunter-biden-ew-1037a-a0932e.jpg" height="800" width="1200"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:28:40 GMT</pubDate><title>U.S. Attorney Jeanine Pirro’s team acknowledged screwup in case against former FBI officials</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:28:40 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Henry J. Gomez</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:16 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The ad roiled Ohio’s race for governor, with the Trump-endorsed Ramaswamy and Acton, the Democratic nominee, vying to lead the state.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/vivek-ramaswamys-ad-using-amy-actons-estranged-mother-ended-run-tv-rcna606441</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/vivek-ramaswamys-ad-using-amy-actons-estranged-mother-ended-run-tv-rcna606441</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-Vivek-Ramaswamy-vsb-1729-dbab1c.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>Jon Cherry</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Republican gubernatorial candidate Vivek Ramaswamy.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Many, including term-limited Gov. Mike DeWine, a Republican who has endorsed Vivek Ramaswamy, pictured, had called on him to take down the ad.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-Vivek-Ramaswamy-vsb-1729-dbab1c.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:16 GMT</pubDate><title>Vivek Ramaswamy’s attack ad against Amy Acton’s ends TV run</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:16 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>The Associated Press</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:43:00 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Allisha Gray scored 23 points and Rhyne Howard had 21 as the hot-shooting Atlanta Dream held off Golden State’s late rally to take an 80-69 victory over the Valkyries in Game 6 on Thursday and pull even in the WNBA Finals.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/sports/wnba/atlanta-dream-golden-state-valkyries-wnba-finals-game-6-result-rcna606438</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/sports/wnba/atlanta-dream-golden-state-valkyries-wnba-finals-game-6-result-rcna606438</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-Allisha-Gray-dream-wnba-ww-1428-6f5043.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Kevin C. Cox</media:credit><media:text type="plain">On-court actin during the 2026 WNBA Finals.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Allisha Gray of the Atlanta Dream drives to the basket during Game 6 of the 2026 WNBA Finals in Atlanta, on Thursday.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-WNBA-Finals-ww-1432-204c3e.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Jonathan Bachman</media:credit><media:text type="plain">On-court action during the 2026 WNBA Finals.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Allisha Gray of the Atlanta Dream drives to the basket during Game 6 of the 2026 WNBA Finals in Atlanta, on Thursday.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-Allisha-Gray-dream-wnba-ww-1428-6f5043.jpg" height="1666" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:43:00 GMT</pubDate><title>Dream beat Valkyries 80-69 to force Game 7 of WNBA Finals</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:43:00 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Evan Bush</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:29:48 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>A line of thunderstorms could stretch from Texas to Missouri on Tuesday, with rain in Iowa and strong winds in Kansas.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/weather/storms/election-day-weather-forecast-storms-rain-key-states-rcna606398</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/weather/storms/election-day-weather-forecast-storms-rain-key-states-rcna606398</link><media