w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-trump-ohio-mn-0935-7c73dd.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:04:30 GMT</pubDate><title>Trump’s final sprint: From the Politics Desk</title><updateDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:04:30 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Marlene Lenthang</dc:creator><dc:creator>Joe Kottke</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Meriam Bouarrouj</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Daniel Arkin</dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:52:28 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The beloved star of the “Star Trek” and “X-Men” franchises died Wednesday following diagnoses of Alzheimer’s disease and Lewy body dementia.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/pop-culture-news/patrick-stewart-actor-known-iconic-roles-jean-luc-picard-professor-x-d-rcna606420</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/pop-culture-news/patrick-stewart-actor-known-iconic-roles-jean-luc-picard-professor-x-d-rcna606420</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-patrick-stewart-ch-1543-17a31c.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Aaron Rapoport</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Patrick Stewart.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Patrick Stewart as Captain Jean-Luc Picard in Star Trek.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-patrick-stewart-christmas-carol-ONETIMEUSEmn-1600-0f3253.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1442" width="2163"><media:credit>Hallmark Entertainment</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Patrick Stewart in &#34;A Christmas Croal&#34;</media:text><media:description type="plain">Stewart in &#34;A Christmas Carol&#34; in 1999.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-patrick-stewart-ch-1609-23ebf6.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>WPA Pool</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Patrick Stewart.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Stewart after he was knighted by Britain&#39;s Queen Elizabeth II at Buckingham Palace in 2010.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-patrick-stewart-ch-1605-f5e820.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Jamie McCarthy</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Patrick Stewart.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Stewart in 2017.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-patrick-stewart-memorial-vsb-2116-d9f20f.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>Chris Delmas</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Flowers are placed on Sir Patrick Stewart&#39;s star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Flowers are placed on Stewart&#39;s star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame following the announcement of his death, on Thursday.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261029-patrick-stewart-ch-1543-17a31c.jpg" height="1666" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:52:28 GMT</pubDate><title>Patrick Stewart, actor known for iconic roles in ‘Star Trek’ and ‘X-Men,’ dies at 86</title><updateDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:54:27 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Daniella Silva</dc:creator><dc:creator>Hernan Muñoz</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:45:48 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>What we know about the deadly high-speed train crash in Spain</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www